    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK4j9CagbdkgRluwkqYLufoE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rM1VGWlZZVzVGYTFkc1p6WkRUbXhuVVdwbFZWRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "Beautiful interior, very special experience. Book beforehand, very popular place. Prices adequate, pizzas thin, crunchy and tasty. Giant lemon pie is fantastically looking (but too sweet to my taste). The only nuances: I was not provided with the tap water I ordered. The table was wobbly. The bill came late. About 100GBP for 4 people (2 pizzas, tartar, green side, 2 soft drinks, 1 glass of wine, 1 cocktail, lemon pie and a tea pot). Authentic place overall.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
